'''Snowy''' is a [[rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is turquoise in color with a minimalistic silhouette of a forest undergoing a snowstorm. Each set of trees gets gradually darker as it goes down the blade. The guard is silver, and the handle is solid black.

